<title>GERMANY: Dywidag 5-mo building output up 11.5 pct.</title>
<headline>Dywidag 5-mo building output up 11.5 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MUNICH, Germany 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Five months to May 31</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group construction output	     1,585   vs 1,421</p>
<p>    Group incoming orders		   1,596   vs 1,569</p>
<p>    Orders in hand			    3,750   vs 3,511</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German construction group is Dywidag AG. The numbers were released at the company's annual shareholder meeting.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
